{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "framework": "playwright",
  "testId": "testim-migrated/tests/webstore/pdp/verify-configurable-product-details-on-pdp-variant1.spec.ts > Webstore - PDP > verify configurable product details on pdp (variant1)",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest searches the webstore for a configurable parent product by SKU, opens its PDP, selects variant 1 by its Bulb Size/Color/Technology swatches, and validates the variant's details, tiered offers, stock status, info tabs and the Frequently Bought / You May Also Like related products. Read-only; nothing is added to the cart.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore as a guest (empty storageState).",
      "Search for the parent product SKU and assert 'Showing 1 of 1 Results'.",
      "Open the first search result (configurable product PDP).",
      "Assert the attribute groups Bulb Size, Color and Technology, then choose variant 1 by its size, color and technology swatches.",
      "Assert breadcrumb, product name, SKU, brand, short description, retail price, rating, wishlist heart and image of the selected variant.",
      "Assert the three tiered special offers (buy quantity, price per item, discount percentage).",
      "Inventory section is skipped for this data (isInventorySectionDisplayed=false); assert the stock status text.",
      "Assert Print, See More and Email a Friend buttons and the Details, Specifications, Shipping Info, Reviews and Additional Information tabs and panels.",
      "Assert the Frequently Bought and You May Also Like sections and their product cards (name, Read Reviews, Add to Cart visible)."
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "product",
      "brand",
      "category",
      "store"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [],
    "assertions": [
      "Search for the parent SKU shows exactly one result ('Showing 1 of 1 Results').",
      "Attribute groups contain the labels Bulb Size, Color and Technology.",
      "Breadcrumb equals Home/<category>/<variant name>; heading, SKU:<variant SKU>, Brand:<brand>, short description and retail price match the variant.",
      "Three tiered offers show 'Buy N or more', '$<price>/item' and 'Save <discount>%'.",
      "Stock status contains 'In Stock'.",
      "Details, specifications, shipping info and additional information tab panels contain the expected text.",
      "Frequently Bought and You May Also Like sections list the expected related product names with Read Reviews and Add to Cart."
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Title 'verify configurable product details on pdp (variant1)' and step labels '1) Open the configurable product PDP' and '2) Select variant 1 + validate all product details' match the flow.",
      "Spec line 24 searches data.parentProductSKU; line 31 calls validateConfigurableVariant(productDetailPage, data.productVariant) (configurable-pdp.helper.ts:90-193).",
      "Profile: parent SKU b-100000 FOUND as ConfigurableProduct, active, store MaxwellsHardware (2 rows matched; first row used). Its observed name/brand (Philips Base B22 9-Watt Bulb / Philips) do not match the asserted variant (Ecosmart LED bulb z-2510001).",
      "Profile: variant SKU z-2510001 FOUND as SimpleProduct, active, inventory 100, store MaxwellsHardware; related products all FOUND as active SimpleProducts on MaxwellsHardware.",
      "No add-to-cart, checkout or admin action; no linked AIO cases.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: parentProductSKU -> pdp.parentProductSku; the swatch labels (sizeLable, colorLable, techologyLable) and swatch tokens (productSize, productColor, productTechnology = 'img' + value) -> pdp.swatches ('Label=Value|...', display order) of the described variant.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Variant details -> pdp: productName variantName, productSKU variantSku, productCategory category, productBrand brand, productShortDescription shortDescription, productPrice price (guest price), inventory inStockMessage, productDetails details, productSpecifications specifications, productShippingInfo shippingInfo, productAdditionalInfo additionalInfo.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Tier offers productVariant.specialOffer.buyQty1..3 / offerPrice1..3 -> pdp.tier1..3Qty / tier1..3Price (tiers by quantity).",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Related products: the variant specs read only names and SKUs, which pdp.frequentlyBought / pdp.youMayAlsoLike ('SKU:Name|...', parent links in display order) already return, so no PRODUCT_LINKED_PRODUCTS need is added.",
      "Remap 2026-11-03: Not produced: the presence flags isSpecialOfferPresent, isInventorySectionDisplayed, isFrequentlyBoughtProductsPresent, isYouMayAlsoLikePresent stay config (the spec can derive them from tier1Qty / inventory / list outputs being set)."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_CONFIGURABLE_PDP_DETAILS",
      "alias": "pdp",
      "params": {
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "quantityUsed": 1
      },
      "preferred": {
        "source": 0,
        "required": false
      }
    }
  ],
